node_modules/
server/pki/
runs/
# Sysmac Studio projects: 2 MB of build output each, and Studio's own .backup copies
plc/*.smc2
plc/*.smc2.backup
plc/*.bak
# Imported CAD is confidential (docs/PLAN.md Part B). The robot meshes under assets/robots/ are
# NOT: they are BSD, vendored with their licence, and the scenes need them to draw at all.
assets/cad/

# Vendor robot CAD and the shells built from it. A maker's CAD from a member area is not ours to
# redistribute by default: tools/step_to_stl.py rebuilds these from the download, and every scene
# falls back to its primitives when they are not there. The NDESO-087 shells are the exception:
# they are committed as assets/robots/anuuu.zip (licence confirmed by Denny, 2026-09-23).
assets/robots/ndeso087/
tools/__pycache__/
